  "source_ref": "Two-hop join: ALINX Z7-P/Z11-P base-board schematic Rev 1.0 (shared PCB; FMC HPC J13 sheets 15-17 for FMC pin -> net, SoM-socket sheets 2-3 for net -> B2B pins J29-J32) joined to ACU11EG System on Module User Manual (EN) section 1.9 Connector Pin Definitions (J29-J32 pin -> signal -> XCZU11EG ball). Balls are on the ZU11EG of the mated ACU11EG SoM. All 112 signals shared with the Z7-P kit UG pin table land on identical FFVC1156 balls (independently re-derived, not assumed). HA00-HA22 (23 pairs, banks 69/64), absent from the Z7-P kit UG, are included here from the schematic socket join since the ACU11EG manual documents every B2B pin; HA port-to-pin pairing was offset-calibrated against 100+ anchor signals and visually verified on rendered sheets. FMC JTAG (TCK/TDI/TDO/TMS) appears only on the FMC connector sheet and does not reach the SoM socket - excluded. PG_C2M excluded: schematic sheet 15 shows FMC pin D1 terminating at a 4.7K pullup to +3.3V only; the Z7-P kit UG row mapping FMC_PG_C2M to ball K9 is a vendor-doc erratum (K9 = B87_L8_P carries TRIG_IN from the external trigger connector, sheet 18). CLK2/CLK3_BIDIR, HB bus and DP8/9 positions are no-connect. VREF_A_M2C wired but excluded by repo convention. GBTCLK/CLK paths direct-wired; population not BOM-verified (no BOM pages in the 19-page schematic).",
